.TH ALI-SHRINE 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-shrine \- idle oracle screensaver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-shrine
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fullscreen black, one oracle WORD plus verse in white, fresh
consultation every 12 seconds. Any key or click wakes. Normally
summoned by terrydavis after 10 idle minutes, but runs fine by
hand for ambience.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-oracle (1),
.BR templeos (8)
